@startuml
' Source block: uml251_04_deployment (uml-2.5.1-legend.puml intake)
!include ../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/deployment-diagram-style.iuml
' ============================================================================
' Section 04 — Deployment
'
' UML traceability:
'   UML 2.5.1 §19.2 Deployments
'   UML 2.5.1 §19.3 Artifacts
'   UML 2.5.1 §19.5 Nodes
'
' PlantUML support: Native for node/artifact shapes; Partial for
' specialized UML deployment metaclasses and exact stereotypes/keywords.
' ============================================================================

title UML 2.5.1 Notation Reference — Deployment
left to right direction
' Framework monochrome mode (replaces `skinparam monochrome true`).
UML_MONOCHROME()

node "Application Host" as AppHost <<device>> {
  node "JVM" as JVM <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "orders.jar" as OrdersJar
  }
}

node "Database Host" as DbHost <<device>> {
  node "DBMS" as DBMS <<executionEnvironment>>
  artifact "schema.sql" as Schema
}

artifact "config.yaml" as Config
component "Order Component" as OrderComponent

AppHost -- DbHost : CommunicationPath
Config ..> AppHost : <<deploy>>
OrdersJar ..> OrderComponent : <<manifest>>

note bottom of AppHost
  UML Node is a DeploymentTarget.
  Device and ExecutionEnvironment are specialized Nodes.
  PlantUML uses node plus UML keyword/stereotype text here
  because it has no distinct first-class device or
  execution-environment declaration.
end note

note bottom of Config
  UML deployment notation:
  when shown outside a DeploymentTarget, a Deployment
  is a dashed Dependency-style arrow labeled «deploy»,
  directed from deployed Artifact to DeploymentTarget.
end note

note bottom of OrdersJar
  Artifact: UML classifier-style rectangle with «artifact»
  keyword or document icon. Manifestation is a dashed
  open-arrow dependency labeled «manifest».
end note

legend
  |= UML concept |= Mapping |
  | Node | Native |
  | Device | Partial: node + «device» |
  | ExecutionEnvironment | Partial: node + «executionEnvironment» |
  | Artifact | Native |
  | Deployment | Partial: dependency + «deploy» |
  | CommunicationPath | Native Association-style link |
  | Manifestation | Partial: dependency + «manifest» |
endlegend
@enduml
